  "termsWarranty": "As section 6 of the MPL 2.0 says, the app is provided \"as is\", without any warranty, whether express, implied, or statutory. There is no promise that it is free of defects, fit for any particular purpose, or non-infringing. You take on the entire risk as to its quality and performance. If it turns out to be defective, you, and not any contributor, bear the cost of any servicing, repair, or correction.",
